!README.md
# ...except this one — read from disk at runtime (LlmChatClient's system
# prompt), not just documentation. A deploy built from a git checkout (e.g.
# Render) is missing it entirely without this, so every chat message 500s
# on fs.readFileSync ENOENT.
!packages/ai/prompts/assistant.md

# Built from apps/widget (pnpm --filter widget build:loader:dashboard), not edited by hand
apps/dashboard/public/chatbot.js
